{"sections":[{"slug":"Grothendieck函数–层字典","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Grothendieck函数–层字典"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">函数</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">层字典</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Grothendieck 函数–层字典”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于一个可构造</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/l-进层","text":"l-<span lang=\"zh\">进层</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">取其</span> $\\mathbb F_{q^m}$-<span lang=\"zh\">点处的茎上</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Frobenius共轭类","text":"Frobenius <span lang=\"zh\">共轭类</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的迹</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即得到</span> $\\mathbb F_{q^m}$-<span lang=\"zh\">点的集合上的一个函数</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">更一般地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/l-进层","text":"l-<span lang=\"zh\">进层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的复形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">取</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Frobenius共轭类","text":"Frobenius <span lang=\"zh\">共轭类</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的迹的交错和</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">层</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">复形</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">到函数的对应与一些操作相容</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">层的拉回对应函数的拉回</span>,</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">紧支集层的推前对应函数的逐纤维积分</span>. ("},{"Local":{"url":"/Grothendieck–Lefschetz迹公式","text":"Grothendieck–Lefschetz <span lang=\"zh\">迹公式</span>"}},{"Plain":")</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">在</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/l-进层","text":"l-<span lang=\"zh\">进层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的导出范畴中</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">我们希望找一个</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Abel范畴","text":"Abel <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">使得层</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">复形</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">到函数的对应为单射</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">答案是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/偏屈层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">偏屈层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的范畴</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></strong>. $\\mathrm{GL}_n(F)\\backslash\\mathrm{GL}_n(\\mathbb A) / \\mathrm{GL}_n(\\mathcal O)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的非分歧自守函数对应</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/主丛的模空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">主丛的模空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathrm{Bun}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的偏屈层</span>.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Assigning to a perverse sheaf its “trace of Frobenius” function, we obtain an iden tification between the Grothendieck group of $\\mathcal P_{G(\\mathcal O)}$ and the algebra of $G(\\mathcal O)$–invariant functions on $G(F)/G(\\mathcal O)$, i.e., the spherical Hecke algebra. In that sense, $\\mathcal P_{G(\\mathcal O)}$ is a <strong>categorification</strong> of the Hecke algebra. — Frenkel, Recent Advances in the Langlands Program</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/佐武等价","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">佐武等价</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}